2026-07-27T12:05:36.5865679Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:05:36.5866153Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:05:36.5866885Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:05:36.5868003Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:05:36.5869310Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
